{"data":[{"traceID":"e01fdadbc57940bc40b6fa0a846651b8","spans":[{"traceID":"e01fdadbc57940bc40b6fa0a846651b8","spanID":"47ab5ff3a7c020e9","operationName":"account-db_production","references":[{"refType":"CHILD_OF","traceID":"e01fdadbc57940bc40b6fa0a846651b8","spanID":"32321ad6873e5ac7"}],"startTime":1789289904615384,"duration":895,"tags":[{"key":"otel.scope.name","type":"string","value":"OpenTelemetry::Instrumentation::PG"},{"key":"otel.scope.version","type":"string","value":"0.30.1"},{"key":"db.collection.name","type":"string","value":"roots"},{"key":"db.name","type":"string","value":"account-db_production"},{"key":"db.statement","type":"string","value":"WITH RECURSIVE roots(root_id, organization_id, seed_ids) AS (\n  VALUES ($?::uuid, $?::uuid, $?::uuid[])\n),\naccount_ancestry(root_id, organization_id, id, parent_account_id, name, level, path) AS (\n  SELECT roots.root_id, roots.organization_id, accounts.id, accounts.parent_account_id, accounts.name, ? AS level, ARRAY[accounts.id]::uuid[] AS path\n  FROM roots\n  INNER JOIN accounts ON accounts.id = roots.root_id\n\n  UNION ALL\n\n  SELECT account_ancestry.root_id, account_ancestry.organization_id, parents.id, parents.parent_account_id, parents.name, account_ancestry.level + ?, account_ancestry.path || parents.id\n  FROM account_ancestry\n  INNER JOIN roots ON roots.root_id = account_ancestry.root_id\n  INNER JOIN accounts parents ON parents.id = account_ancestry.parent_account_id\n  WHERE parents.id = ANY(roots.seed_ids)\n    AND NOT parents.id = ANY(account_ancestry.path)\n    AND account_ancestry.level + ? < ?\n)\nSELECT root_id, organization_id, id, parent_account_id, name, level\nFROM account_ancestry\nORDER BY root_id, level DESC\n ?"},{"key":"db.system","type":"string","value":"postgresql"},{"key":"db.user","type":"string","value":"account-db-production-user"},{"key":"net.peer.ip","type":"string","value":"172.21.0.25"},{"key":"net.peer.name","type":"string","value":"account-db"},{"key":"net.peer.port","typ